{
  "title": "enrolld · O3 告警与看板",
  "rows": [
    {
      "name": "业务",
      "question": "请求是否成功完成",
      "cards": [
        {
          "title": "01 · 读请求达标率 / 错误预算",
          "note": "以读请求成功且 ≤50ms 的比例替代完整选课完成率。99% 目标；1m、5m 燃烧率均 >14.4 持续 30s 告警。",
          "queries": [
            {
              "name": "读 SLI · 1m",
              "expr": "100 * (1 - enrolld:read_slo_burn:ratio1m{job=\"enrolld\"} * 0.01)",
              "unit": "%",
              "target": 99,
              "id": "1-1-1"
            },
            {
              "name": "燃烧率 · 1m",
              "expr": "enrolld:read_slo_burn:ratio1m{job=\"enrolld\"}",
              "unit": "倍",
              "target": 14.4,
              "id": "1-1-2"
            },
            {
              "name": "燃烧率 · 5m",
              "expr": "enrolld:read_slo_burn:ratio5m{job=\"enrolld\"}",
              "unit": "倍",
              "target": 14.4,
              "id": "1-1-3"
            }
          ],
          "id": "1-1"
        },
        {
          "title": "02 · 请求成功率 / 提交成功率",
          "note": "HTTP 200 成功率。提交仅排除 400 输入拒绝；无提交时显示无数据。其他非 200 仍计为失败。",
          "queries": [
            {
              "name": "读请求成功率",
              "expr": "100 * ((sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=\"/api/courses/{id}\",code=\"200\"}[1m])) or (0 * sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=\"/api/courses/{id}\"}[1m])))) / sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=\"/api/courses/{id}\"}[1m])))",
              "unit": "%",
              "id": "1-2-1"
            },
            {
              "name": "提交成功率",
              "expr": "100 * ((sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=\"/api/enroll\",code=\"200\"}[1m])) or (0 * sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=\"/api/enroll\",code!=\"400\"}[1m])))) / sum(rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=\"/api/enroll\",code!=\"400\"}[1m])))",
              "unit": "%",
              "id": "1-2-2"
            }
          ],
          "id": "1-2"
        },
        {
          "title": "03 · 在线人数：未埋点",
          "note": "样例没有用户会话和在线人数指标。以下仅作连接侧核对：主机全部 TCP 连接与 conntrack 条目均不等于人数。",
          "queries": [
            {
              "name": "主机 TCP 已建立连接",
              "expr": "node_netstat_Tcp_CurrEstab{job=\"node\"}",
              "unit": "个",
              "id": "1-3-1"
            },
            {
              "name": "主机 conntrack 条目",
              "expr": "node_nf_conntrack_entries{job=\"node\"}",
              "unit": "个",
              "id": "1-3-2"
            }
          ],
          "id": "1-3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "服务 · RED",
      "question": "谁在等待",
      "cards": [
        {
          "title": "04 · 按接口 QPS / 错误率",
          "note": "按路由模板聚合。5xx 为服务错误；499 属于客户端中断，只进入全部请求分母。",
          "queries": [
            {
              "name": "接口 QPS",
              "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=~\"/api/courses/.*|/api/enroll\"}[1m]))",
              "unit": "req/s",
              "id": "2-1-1"
            },
            {
              "name": "接口 5xx",
              "expr": "100 * ((sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=~\"/api/courses/.*|/api/enroll\",code=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or on (route) (0 * sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=~\"/api/courses/.*|/api/enroll\"}[1m])))) / sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"enrolld\",route=~\"/api/courses/.*|/api/enroll\"}[1m])))",
              "unit": "%",
              "id": "2-1-2"
            }
          ],
          "id": "2-1"
        },
        {
          "title": "05 · 按接口 p50 / p99",
          "note": "服务端入口到返回的耗时，含全部状态码。先合并桶再算分位数；插值误差取决于桶宽，不能与客户端 p99 等同。",
          "queries": [
            {
              "name": "p50 / p99",
              "expr": "label_replace((1000 * histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (route, le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"enrolld\",route=~\"/api/courses/.*|/api/enroll\"}[1m])))), \"quantile\", \"p50\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace((1000 * histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (route, le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"enrolld\",route=~\"/api/courses/.*|/api/enroll\"}[1m])))), \"quantile\", \"p99\", \"\", \"\")",
              "unit": "ms",
              "id": "2-2-1",
              "target": 50
            }
          ],
          "id": "2-2"
        },
        {
          "title": "06 · 在途请求 / 连接池等待",
          "note": "inflight 是在途请求，不是在线人数。样例未使用 Kafka；池等待含获取失败前的等待。",
          "queries": [
            {
              "name": "在途请求",
              "expr": "http_inflight_requests{job=\"enrolld\",route=~\"/api/courses/.*|/api/enroll\"}",
              "unit": "个",
              "id": "2-3-1"
            },
            {
              "name": "池占用",
              "expr": "100 * db_pool_in_use{job=\"enrolld\"} / db_pool_size{job=\"enrolld\"}",
              "unit": "%",
              "target": 100,
              "id": "2-3-2"
            },
            {
              "name": "池等待 p99",
              "expr": "1000 * histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(db_pool_wait_seconds_bucket{job=\"enrolld\"}[1m])))",
              "unit": "ms",
              "id": "2-3-3"
            }
          ],
          "id": "2-3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "资源 · USE",
      "question": "在等待什么",
      "cards": [
        {
          "title": "07 · CPU / 内存",
          "note": "服务绑核 2、3；busy 不含 idle/iowait。运行队列、steal、可用内存为整机指标，包含其他进程。",
          "queries": [
            {
              "name": "服务核 busy",
              "expr": "100 * sum(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node\",cpu=~\"2|3\",mode!~\"idle|iowait\"}[1m])) / count(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node\",cpu=~\"2|3\",mode=\"idle\"})",
              "unit": "%",
              "id": "3-1-1"
            },
            {
              "name": "主机运行队列",
              "expr": "node_procs_running{job=\"node\"}",
              "unit": "线程",
              "id": "3-1-2"
            },
            {
              "name": "主机 steal",
              "expr": "100 * avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node\",mode=\"steal\"}[1m]))",
              "unit": "%",
              "id": "3-1-3"
            },
            {
              "name": "可用内存",
              "expr": "node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"node\"} / 1073741824",
              "unit": "GiB",
              "id": "3-1-4"
            }
          ],
          "id": "3-1"
        },
        {
          "title": "08 · 磁盘 / 持久化",
          "note": "vda 为数据目录所在真实云盘。读实验不主动写入；磁盘计数可能来自其他进程。样例没有 MySQL buffer pool。",
          "queries": [
            {
              "name": "写 await",
              "expr": "1000 * rate(node_disk_write_time_seconds_total{job=\"node\",device=\"vda\"}[1m]) / rate(node_disk_writes_completed_total{job=\"node\",device=\"vda\"}[1m])",
              "unit": "ms",
              "id": "3-2-1"
            },
            {
              "name": "磁盘忙碌",
              "expr": "100 * rate(node_disk_io_time_seconds_total{job=\"node\",device=\"vda\"}[1m])",
              "unit": "%",
              "id": "3-2-2"
            },
            {
              "name": "磁盘 aqu-sz",
              "expr": "rate(node_disk_io_time_weighted_seconds_total{job=\"node\",device=\"vda\"}[1m])",
              "unit": "个",
              "id": "3-2-3"
            }
          ],
          "id": "3-2"
        },
        {
          "title": "09 · 网络 / 丢弃",
          "note": "读压测走 lo；eth0 为主机外部流量。ListenOverflows 显示增量速率，不把历史累计值误判为当前故障。",
          "queries": [
            {
              "name": "eth0 发送",
              "expr": "8 * rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{job=\"node\",device=\"eth0\"}[1m]) / 1000000",
              "unit": "Mbit/s",
              "id": "3-3-1"
            },
            {
              "name": "lo 发送",
              "expr": "8 * rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{job=\"node\",device=\"lo\"}[1m]) / 1000000",
              "unit": "Mbit/s",
              "id": "3-3-2"
            },
            {
              "name": "监听队列溢出",
              "expr": "rate(node_netstat_TcpExt_ListenOverflows{job=\"node\"}[1m])",
              "unit": "次/s",
              "id": "3-3-3"
            }
          ],
          "id": "3-3"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
